                </div>

                <!-- Right: Scrolling Items -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 md:space-y-8 min-w-0 services-list">
                    <!-- Card 1 -->
                    <a href="/services/visibility-search/seo-aeo-agency-in-thane"
                        class="block bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-8 md:p-10 rounded-2xl opacity-0 translate-y-8 group hover:border-white/30 transition-[border-color] duration-300">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                            <div class="text-4xl text-white/30 font-extrabold">01</div>
                            <div class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-white/30"></div>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-3 leading-tight tracking-tight">
                            Search and Answer Engine Optimization (SEO / AEO)</h3>
                        <p class="text-base md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400 max-w-2xl">Rank on
                            Google and get cited inside AI answers on ChatGPT, Gemini and Google AI Overviews. The two
                            are no longer separate disciplines, and treating them that way is how brands fall behind.
                            Includes: technical SEO audits, keyword and topical strategy, on-page and content
                            optimisation, answer-engine-structured content, schema markup, backlinking and reporting.
                        </p>
                    </a>
                    <!-- Card 2 -->
                    <a href="/services/visibility-search/social-media-marketing-agency-in-thane"
                        class="block bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-8 md:p-10 rounded-2xl opacity-0 translate-y-8 group hover:border-white/30 transition-[border-color] duration-300">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                            <div class="text-4xl text-white/30 font-extrabold">02</div>
                            <div class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-white/30"></div>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-3 leading-tight tracking-tight">
                            Social Media Marketing</h3>
                        <p class="text-base md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400 max-w-2xl">A presence
                            that actually has a point. Platform-specific content, steady posting and real community
                            management tied to business goals, not vanity numbers. Includes: content calendars and
                            posting, community management, paid social amplification, platform strategy across
                            Instagram, LinkedIn and more.</p>
                    </a>
                    <!-- Card 3 -->
                    <a href="/services/visibility-search/content-writing-services-in-thane"
                        class="block bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-8 md:p-10 rounded-2xl opacity-0 translate-y-8 group hover:border-white/30 transition-[border-color] duration-300">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                            <div class="text-4xl text-white/30 font-extrabold">03</div>
                            <div class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-white/30"></div>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-3 leading-tight tracking-tight">
                            Content Writing</h3>
                        <p class="text-base md:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400 max-w-2xl">Content built
                            around what your buyers are searching for, not whatever was easy to write that week.
                            Includes: blog and article strategy, SEO-led writing, content calendars, repurposing across
                            channels, performance tracking.</p>
                    </a>
                    <!-- Card 4 -->
