                    <div class="pb-6 text-gray-600 font-medium text-base leading-relaxed hidden answer max-w-3xl">
                        SEO gets you ranked in Google’s list of links. AEO structures that same content so AI engines
                        like ChatGPT and Google AI Overviews can pull it out and cite it as the answer. They share a
                        technical and content base, so running them separately just doubles the work. We build both from
                        one strategy.
                    </div>
